{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31533","headline":"池州封员外郡斋双鹤丹顶霜翎仙态浮旷罢政之日因呈此章 · 李羣玉","name":"池州封员外郡斋双鹤丹顶霜翎仙态浮旷罢政之日因呈此章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潇洒二白鹤，对之高兴清。\n寒溪侣云水，朱阁伴琴笙。\n顾慕稻粱惠，超遥江海情。\n应携帝乡去，仙阙看飞鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}